Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.52,0:00:51.02,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(526,513)\blur5}愛してるって何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:55.78,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,476)\blur5}辞書を引いてもピンと来なくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:01:00.53,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,430)\blur5\fad(200,200)}そうね、愛って何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:06.96,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,520)}語り尽くせぬこの痛みが愛なんかも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:12.69,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(524,500)}始まりの対に終わりを創る
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:17.14,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}神様はとても残酷だよね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:22.39,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}人間はきっと勇敢なんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:22.39,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fs35\pos(780,2)}ぼくら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:27.31,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,516)}終わりを知れどまだ前へ進むから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:32.48,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)}何を引き換えにしようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.09,0:01:37.51,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}何度だって汚すよこの手なら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:42.19,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}後悔に似た罪の意識
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.17,0:01:47.24,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}隠して歩む道は何処へと続くの
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:52.62,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}いつか君が死んじゃうって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.62,0:01:55.88,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}想像するだけで痛いんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.88,0:01:58.55,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(526,0)}心臓を握りつぶすのは誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.88,0:01:58.55,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(526,0)\fs35\pos(770,2)}こころ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.55,0:02:00.73,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,200)}キミが愛なんだろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.73,0:02:03.39,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}いつか二人を引き離す終わりが
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:05.43,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}迎えに来ようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:10.92,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)}誰も追いつけやしないスピードで
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:15.02,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)}どこまでも逃げてみせるよ
Comment: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,————OPCN————
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.52,0:00:51.02,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fsp4\fad(526,513)\blur5\fad(200,200)}永恒的爱到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:55.78,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,476)\blur5\fad(200,200)\fsp4}翻遍字典都毫无头绪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:01:00.53,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,430)\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}是啊、爱到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:06.96,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,520)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}或许这份道不清说不明的痛楚便是爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:12.69,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(524,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}有开始便会创造结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:17.14,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}神明真是残忍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:22.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}作为人类的我们定是生性勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:27.31,OPCN,,0,0,10,,{\blur5\fad(200,516)\fad(200,200)\fsp4)}即便知道会走向结束也不断迈步前行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:32.48,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}无论付出什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.09,0:01:37.51,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}这双肮脏的双手早已
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:42.19,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}充斥着无异于遗憾的负罪感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.17,0:01:47.24,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}隐藏的道路将会延续到何处
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:52.62,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}一想起你终有一日会死去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.62,0:01:55.88,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}我就万分痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.88,0:01:58.55,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(526,0)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}让我心碎的人究竟是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.55,0:02:00.73,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}你便是所谓的爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.73,0:02:03.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}尽管会将二人分离的结局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:05.43,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}始终都会来临
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:10.92,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}我也会以迅雷不及掩耳之势
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:15.02,OPCN,,0,0,5,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}逃脱给你看
Comment: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,————EDJP————
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:11.27,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.27,0:22:14.14,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Goodbye old self goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.09,0:22:26.44,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Now it’s time for me to take a breath
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.78,0:22:31.24,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You know I don’t want to lose anything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.22,0:22:35.50,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Don’t wanna see the end I need this more
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.75,0:22:40.32,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(915,15)}I want to feel the warmth I can’t let go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.32,0:22:44.51,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not gonna give it up because I know my strength
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.91,0:22:49.49,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I’m barely breathing but I’m keepin’ up to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.24,0:22:55.72,EDEN,,0,0,1,,{\fad(200,200)}I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.17,0:22:59.63,EDEN,,0,0,1,,{\fad(200,200)}I hide my trembling hand and just keep pushin’ on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:04.90,EDEN,,0,0,1,,{\fad(200,200)}Cause the things I need to guard gives me the power to conquer carry on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.90,0:23:06.80,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Goodbye old self
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:11.51,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Never going back to the me I fought to leave behind
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:14.65,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Hello new me, this time
Comment: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,————EDCN————
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:11.27,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我已决定变得比周遭都坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.27,0:22:14.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}再见  曾经的我  再也不见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.09,0:22:26.44,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}是时候让我深吸一口气
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.78,0:22:31.24,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我什么都不想失去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.22,0:22:35.50,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}只有更加努力才能避免最坏的结局
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.75,0:22:40.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4\pos(940,1065)}想感受无法释怀的温存
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.32,0:22:44.51,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我深知我的无力  因而我永不言弃
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.91,0:22:49.49,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}就算快要窒息  我也要守护住现在的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.24,0:22:55.72,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我已决定变得比周遭都坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.17,0:22:59.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我必须藏起颤抖的手  继续前行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:04.90,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}因为我要守护的东西给了我战胜怯弱的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.90,0:23:06.80,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}再见  曾经的我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:11.51,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}再也不会变回那个我努力抛之于后的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:14.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}你好  新生的我  此时此刻
